#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:27
msgid ""
"成功打包后，公开站点和离线包的 manifest 由实际构建输入生成。Git HEAD 可以因文档提交改变； 这里不手填一个很快漂移的 HEAD "
"常量。未打包的工作树可执行 `git rev-parse HEAD` 核对 checkout，但命令输出本身不是 qualification "
"receipt。"
msgstr ""
"After successful packaging, manifests for the public site and offline "
"package derive from actual build inputs. Documentation commits may change "
"Git HEAD; this page does not manually insert a rapidly drifting HEAD "
"constant. An unpackaged working tree can run `git rev-parse HEAD` to check "
"its checkout, but that command output alone is not a qualification receipt."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:31
msgid ""
"schema 2 不再隐式引用某个历史索引。打包者逐个显式选入原封存候选，工具调用 同一候选 verifier 核对原始闭包后记录 "
"source、configuration、ELF／BIN／map、 qualified scopes "
"与候选文件摘要。没有选入候选时列表为空，不表示软件失败。 文档包离线校验保护这份引用的字节和结构，不重新执行或代替原候选资格校验。 原 locator "
"只说明当时的存储位置，不是公开下载地址。schema 1 历史包保留原 `qualified_code` 的只读校验，不能用它生产新的默认资格引用。"
msgstr ""
"Schema 2 no longer implicitly references a historical index. The packager "
"explicitly selects each original sealed candidate; the tool invokes the same"
" candidate verifier to check its original closure before recording source, "
"configuration, ELF/BIN/map, qualified scopes and the candidate file digest. "
"With no candidate selected, the list is empty; this does not mean software "
"failed. Offline documentation verification protects these reference bytes "
"and structure; it neither reexecutes nor replaces original candidate "
"qualification verification. The original locator identifies its storage "
"location at that time, not a public download URL. Historical schema 1 "
"packages retain read-only verification of their original `qualified_code`; "
"it cannot produce a new default qualification reference."

