#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:51
msgid ""
"N2/E1 的原本地候选导航分别记录在外部示例仓库的 `build/controlled-dependencies-ce616ea9/delivery-"
"index.json` 和 `build/documentation-controlled-dependencies-"
"ce616ea9/delivery-index.json`。 前者定位原候选、产物与可移植证据；后者定位双语文档包和独立离线恢复记录， 文档发布仍为 "
"`published=false`。这些路径是原主机留存位置，不是公开下载 URL。 Nexus 合并提交 `3ea252c6` 与受测 N2 的 "
"Git tree 相同，示例合并提交 `4a9f5f75` 与受测 E1 的 Git tree 相同；关联保留原受测提交，不改写候选源码。本次后续 C "
"生命周期增量中，`194ca6cb` 已完成其精确源码的 SDK 消费与严格双语文档交付； `d21dfcab` "
"已完成其普通完整索引门禁。后来集成的家族与所有权修正仍须执行最终 源码的完整门禁、SDK、示例、文档、离线双构建与封存。各家族开发计数不可相加， "
"也不覆盖四种 Native 模式或实板验收。"
msgstr ""
"The original local N2/E1 candidate navigation is retained in the external "
"examples repository at `build/controlled-dependencies-ce616ea9/delivery-"
"index.json` and `build/documentation-controlled-dependencies-"
"ce616ea9/delivery-index.json`. The first locates original candidates, "
"artifacts and portable evidence; the second locates the bilingual "
"documentation package and independent offline restore records. Documentation"
" remains `published=false`. These are original execution-host locations, not"
" public download URLs. Nexus merge `3ea252c6` has the same Git tree as "
"tested N2, and examples merge `4a9f5f75` has the same Git tree as tested E1;"
" association retains the original tested commits without rewriting candidate"
" source. In the later C lifecycle increments, `194ca6cb` completed SDK "
"consumption and strict bilingual documentation delivery for its exact "
"source; `d21dfcab` completed its ordinary complete-index gate. Subsequently "
"integrated families and ownership fixes still require the final source's "
"complete gates, SDK, examples, documentation, two offline builds and "
"sealing. Family development counts cannot be added and do not cover all four"
" Native modes or physical acceptance."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:63
msgid ""
"各索引保留原 schema、范围、失败尝试、receipt、归档和 member 身份，不能相加 测试次数、ARM "
"镜像数或任务数量，也不能据此计算全项目完成率。后续文档 commit 只记录这些基线。当前文档的检查、渲染、离线恢复与部署验证各自有独立记录。"
msgstr ""
"Each index preserves its original schema, scope, failed attempts, receipts, "
"archive and member identities. Do not add test counts, ARM images or task "
"counts, or calculate a project-wide completion rate. Later documentation "
"commits only record these baselines. Current documentation checks, "
"rendering, offline recovery and deployment have their own records."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:67
msgid ""
"构建系统记录没有执行一次完整 72-stage 软件总计划，也没有执行 OCI recipe 重建、 CP311 离线安装、Windows/macOS "
"集成或 MCU HIL。独立执行过的具体 scopes 按原索引 解释；不要从其 aggregate 状态扩大结论。其八个无签名软件候选是 H743 "
"HSI64／ Cache off 和 U575 MSIS4／TZEN=0 的 empty／UART、裸机／FreeRTOS 组合。"
msgstr ""
"The build-system record did not execute one complete 72-stage software plan,"
" an OCI recipe rebuild, CP311 offline installation, Windows/macOS "
"integration or MCU HIL. Interpret separately executed scopes through the "
"original index rather than expanding an aggregate status. Its eight unsigned"
" software candidates are H743 HSI64/Cache-off and U575 MSIS4/TZEN=0 "
"empty/UART baremetal/FreeRTOS combinations."

