#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:82
msgid ""
"原 `/workspace/...`、`/dev/shm/...` 是执行主机定位，离开该主机不能当作公开下载。 构建系统索引的 "
"`evidence_navigation` 明确候选归档、candidate document、ELF／BIN／map 和全部 member "
"清单的定位方式。归档当前是原记录的本地留存；没有发布的远程证据 不能伪造下载 URL。文档包包含原 JSON "
"以便核对，并不复制大型原始归档或重签历史字节。"
msgstr ""
"Original `/workspace/...` and `/dev/shm/...` paths locate the execution "
"host; they are not public downloads elsewhere. The build-system index's "
"`evidence_navigation` specifies candidate archives, candidate documents, "
"ELF/BIN/map and complete member-inventory locations. Archives are currently "
"retained locally as recorded; do not invent download URLs for unpublished "
"remote evidence. Documentation packages include original JSON for checking; "
"they do not copy large raw archives or re-sign historical bytes."

